      "start": 0.133,
      "end": 3.536,
      "text": "Excuse me, how do I get to the train station?",
      "translation": "打扰一下，请问火车站怎么走？",
      "notes": "重音：Excuse · get · train · station\n连读：get to → ge-tuh\n提示：Excuse me 的 s 发 /z/；how do I 连读成 how-dai。"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "s_0002",
      "start": 3.778,
      "end": 7.041,
      "text": "Go straight for two blocks, then turn left.",
      "translation": "直走两个街区，然后左转。",
      "notes": "重音：straight · two · blocks · left\n连读：turn left → turn-left\n提示：straight 的 tr 不要读成“吹”；left 的 t 轻而短。"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "s_0003",
      "start": 7.306,
      "end": 8.861,
      "text": "Is it far from here?",
      "translation": "离这儿远吗？",
      "notes": "重音：far · here\n连读：Is it → i-zit；far from → far-frum\n提示：Is it 连读成 i-zit；句尾用升调。"
    },
