      "sentenceId": "s_0004",
      "start": 9.111,
      "end": 11.819,
      "text": "No, it's about a ten-minute walk.",
      "translation": "不远，走路大概十分钟。",
      "notes": "重音：No · ten-minute · walk\n连读：about a → abou-da\n提示：ten-minute 的 t 可以浊化成 d 的音，但重音在 ten。"
